                  <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> <code class="small">object-src 'none'</code> — bloque Flash et plugins</div>
                  <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> <code class="small">base-uri 'self'</code> — empêche base URI attacks</div>
                  <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> <code class="small">form-action 'self'</code> — restreint cibles formulaires</div>
                  <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> Mode <strong>enforcement</strong> en production</div>
                  <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> Rapport violations → <code>/csp-violation-report-endpoint</code></div>
                  <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill text-primary"></i> Nonce generator déjà configuré côté Rails</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

